//! The `list-style` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property allows you to set all the list style properties at once.
//!
//! Initial: list-style-type: disc; list-style-position: outside; list-style-image: none. Inherited:
//! yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - inside: The marker box is outside the principal block box, as described in the section on the
//! ::marker pseudo-element below.
//! - none: No list style is used.
//! - outside: The ::marker pseudo-element is an inline element placed immediately before all
//! ::before pseudo-elements in the principal block box, after which the element's content flows.
//!
//! Grammar: <'list-style-position'> || <'list-style-image'> || <'list-style-type'>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-lists-3/#propdef-list-style
